bfo:gwent_the_witcher_card_game a bfo:VideoGame ;
    bfo:availableOn bfo:Android,
        bfo:Ios,
        bfo:Pc,
        bfo:Playstation4,
        bfo:Xbox_One ;
    bfo:coverImageUrl "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/742/7424c1f7d0a8da9ae29cd866f985698b.jpg"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    bfo:description """Join in The Witcher universe’s favorite card game! In GWENT, you clash with your friends in fast-paced duels that combine bluffing, on-the-fly decision making and careful deck construction. \r
\r
Play your cards right and manage a three-row battle formation as you unleash your hand over a best-of-three series of rounds. With heroes, spells and special abilities that dramatically turn the tide of battle, deception and clever tricks will be necessary parts of your arsenal.\r
\r
Pick your side – command five different factions: the mighty Nilfgaardian Empire, proud Skellige, brutal Monsters, cunning Northern Realms, or shadowy Scoia’tael. \r
\r
Build your deck – collect new cards and deploy armies full of versatile units, unique heroes and rule-flipping cards that summon fog to blind your opponent’s archers or call down dragon fire to destroy their strongest units. \r
\r
Craft new cards – break down unwanted cards and craft new ones to build an ever-evolving deck.""" ;
    bfo:developedBy bfo:Cd_Projekt_Red,
        bfo:Cd_Projekt_Sa ;
    bfo:hasESRBRating bfo:TeenRating ;
    bfo:hasGenre bfo:Board_Games,
