bfo:hardspace_shipbreaker a bfo:VideoGame ;
    bfo:availableOn bfo:Pc,
        bfo:Playstation4,
        bfo:Xbox_One ;
    bfo:coverImageUrl "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/290/290068e3847a26968e29a64737f551a6.jpg"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    bfo:description """Welcome to LYNX, the galaxy’s leading ship-salvaging corporation!\r
Across your career, you’ll have the privilege of paying your debt to us by purchasing salvaging rights to increasingly large and valuable ships. Cut them open and extract as much value as possible!\r
You are equipped with the latest in LYNX tech. Carve entry points, salvage valuable materials and components with your cutting tool or slice scrap metal at any angle into a million pieces as you ponder a lonely existence… the possibilities are endless! Be cautious – dying is extremely unprofitable.\r
We strongly advise upgrading your tools, helmet and suit to take on more lucrative contracts - all you need to worry about is how you’ll pay for it!\r
As of today, your debt amounts to:\r
999,999,999 Credits\r
Good luck on the job, cutter!\r
Experience daily life as a blue-collar spaceship salvager\r
Cut and destroy at will within a next-generation physics simulation\r
Upgrade tools and unlock new perks to take on harder contracts\r
JOIN THE COMMUNITY\r
Hardspace: Shipbreaker is a game in early access. Don’t hesitate to join our official Discord server and share your feedback with the development team so that we can improve Hardspace: Shipbreaker together.""" ;
