    bfo:description """(Make sure you full-screen the screenshots above for HD resolution)\r
Prodeus is the first person shooter of old, re-imagined using modern rendering techniques. It reaches the quality you expect from a AAA experience while adhering to some of the aesthetic technical limits of older hardware.Our Art Style:High Quality 3D Retro Aesthetic\r
A focus on over the top visual effects.\r
Awesome dismemberment system\r
Infinite blood (go crazy, paint the walls red!)\r
Gameplay: Fast pace action\r
Hellish destruction\r
Dynamic Soundtrack\r
Visceral and engaging combat scenarios\r
Heavy duty weaponry\r
A multitude of secrets to discover\r
Replayability:Continuous support\r
User generated content\r
Easy to use Level Editor\r
The Team:Prodeus is being developed by Michael Voeller and Jason Mojica of Bounding Box Software who have a combined 25 years FPS development experience, along with talented freelance artists and designers.""" ;
