    bfo:description """Eight travelers. Eight adventures. Eight roles to play in a new world\r
brought to life by Square Enix. And now, you can enjoy all of them in\r
the new demo. Step into the shoes and live the stories of each of the\r
eight travelers and freely explore the world of Orsterra. Then, carry\r
your choices and adventure into the main game with save data transfer.\r
\r
Use each character’s special abilities in and out of battle. Break\r
through enemy defenses by discovering and targeting weaknesses. Store\r
Boost Points with each turn and then spend them at strategic times to\r
strengthen abilities, chain attacks, or provide aid. Choose the path you\r
wish to walk and discover what lies beyond the horizon.\r
\r
Explore multiple, distinct RPG adventures in a world created by Square\r
Enix\r
\r
Choose from eight characters, each with their own distinct story\r
\r
Deep, strategic turn-based combat with a layered battle system\r
\r
Visuals inspired by retro RPGs, brought to life with modern touches\r
and a rousing, dynamic musical score""" ;
