bfo:sea_of_stars_2 a bfo:VideoGame ;
    bfo:availableOn bfo:Nintendo_Switch,
        bfo:Pc,
        bfo:Playstation4,
        bfo:Playstation5,
        bfo:Xbox_One,
        bfo:Xbox_Series_X ;
    bfo:coverImageUrl "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/1de/1de8ff69ed31d7a47d4f7770f23f20b8.jpg"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    bfo:description """Promising the Sabotage touch in every system, Sea of Stars aims to modernize the classic RPG in terms of turn-based combat, storytelling, exploration and interactions with the environment, while still offering a hearty slice of nostalgia and good old, simple fun.\r
Key ingredients\r
Engaging turn-based combat - Combat gameplay includes active player input during attack animations (timed hits), multi-character combo attacks, boosting, and strategic defense options to hinder enemies while they are channeling a powerful attack or spell. For a more immersive experience, there are no random encounters or transitions to separate battlefields, and no grinding. Both navigation and combat happen in the same environment.\r
Unshackled traversal -  Swim, climb, vault, jump off or hoist up ledges as you run through the world with a navigation system based on platformer expertise that breaks free from the classic bound-to-the-grid tileset movement.\r
Prequel story set in The Messenger’s universe - Dozens of original characters and story arcs will take you on a captivating journey. Sometimes epic, sometimes silly, and other times emotional, Sea of Stars does its RPG duty of exploring classic themes of adventure and friendship, while also being chock-full of the unexpected twists and events you’d expect from a Sabotage production.\r
Full-on dynamic lighting - Our custom-made render pipeline allows the creation of a breathtaking world coming to life by pushing the limits of 2D pixel-art games.\r
The Sabotage treatment on the turn-based RPG genre - Every system has been deeply analyzed to create an experience that pays respect to retro classics, while reworking some elements to offer a modernized experience free of irritants and timesinks.""" ;
    bfo:developedBy bfo:Sabotage_Studio ;
    bfo:hasESRBRating bfo:TeenRating ;
    bfo:hasGenre bfo:Role_Playing_Games_Rpg ;
