bfo:uncharted_the_lost_legacy a bfo:VideoGame ;
    bfo:availableOn bfo:Playstation4,
        bfo:Playstation5 ;
    bfo:coverImageUrl "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/560/56056a71c74f751552c9baedebf8f317.jpg"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    bfo:description """The first installment in the Uncharted series without Nathan Drake. This time the main protagonist is Chloe Frazer, an Indian-Australian treasure hunter and thief for hire. This new take is still a handcrafted action-adventure game by Naughty Dog studios the series is famous for. 

The story starts at the market located in an Indian settlement, where Frazer is looking for an opportunity to make it through to the other part of town. The characters from the last game also appear in this one: Chloe must help renowned mercenary Nadine Ross from Uncharted 4: A Thief’s End. Together they are after a mysterious Indian artefact. 

Like other Uncharted games, The Lost Legacy’s plays from a third-person perspective. Chloe Frazer roams the game world both on foot and by using vehicle  To progress players are bond to use stealth tactics as well as firearms and melee combat. The game heavily emphasizes on solving puzzles and platformer challenges.""" ;
